---
// One login, then one guarded call. Red = every way the guard says no.
const W = 900, H = 360;
---
<figure class="bep7c">
  <div class="bep7c-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top row: the client posts username, password and scope to the token endpoint, which verifies the Argon2 hash and returns a signed token valid 15 minutes. Bottom row: the client sends the token as a Bearer header to the guard get_current_user, which decodes it and then runs the route. The guard can answer 401 for a missing, expired or forged token and 403 for a missing scope.">
    <text x="20" y="22" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>1 · log in once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 · đăng nhập một lần</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="36" width="190" height="72" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/mobile.svg" x="32" y="58" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="72" y="68" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>client</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client</tspan></text>
    <text x="72" y="88" class="sub">POST /token</text>
    <line x1="210" y1="72" x2="322" y2="72" class="ln" /><polygon points="332,72 322,67 322,77" class="hd" />
    <text x="272" y="62" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">user · pw · scope</text>

    <rect x="332" y="36" width="230" height="72" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/lock.svg" x="344" y="58" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="384" y="68" class="nm">login()</text>
    <text x="384" y="88" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>verify hash, sign token</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm hash, ký token</tspan></text>
    <line x1="562" y1="72" x2="662" y2="72" class="ln" /><polygon points="672,72 662,67 662,77" class="hd" />

    <rect x="672" y="36" width="208" height="72" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="776" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>signed JWT</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>JWT đã ký</tspan></text>
    <text x="776" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>sub · scopes · exp 15 min</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sub · scopes · hạn 15 phút</tspan></text>

    <line x1="20" y1="146" x2="880" y2="146" class="sep" />
    <text x="20" y="176" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>2 · every later request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 · mọi request sau đó</tspan></text>

    <rect x="20" y="190" width="190" height="72" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/mobile.svg" x="32" y="212" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="72" y="222" class="nm">client</text>
    <text x="72" y="242" class="sub">GET /reports</text>
    <line x1="210" y1="226" x2="322" y2="226" class="ln" /><polygon points="332,226 322,221 322,231" class="hd" />
    <text x="272" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">Bearer …</text>

    <rect x="332" y="190" width="230" height="72" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/detective.svg" x="344" y="212" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="384" y="222" class="nm">get_current_user</text>
    <text x="384" y="242" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>decode · exp · scopes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>giải mã · exp · scopes</tspan></text>
    <line x1="562" y1="226" x2="662" y2="226" class="ln" /><polygon points="672,226 662,221 662,231" class="hd" />
    <text x="617" y="216" text-anchor="middle" class="sub">200</text>

    <rect x="672" y="190" width="208" height="72" rx="10" class="box" />
    <image href="/icons/flow/engine.svg" x="684" y="212" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true" />
    <text x="724" y="222" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>your route</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>route của bạn</tspan></text>
    <text x="724" y="242" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>runs only if allowed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chỉ chạy khi được phép</tspan></text>

    <line x1="447" y1="262" x2="447" y2="288" class="bad" /><polygon points="447,298 442,288 452,288" class="badhd" />
    <text x="447" y="318" text-anchor="middle" class="bl"><tspan data-lang-en>401  no token · expired · tampered</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>401  thiếu · hết hạn · bị sửa token</tspan></text>
    <text x="447" y="340" text-anchor="middle" class="bl"><tspan data-lang-en>403  token fine, scope missing</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>403  token ổn, thiếu scope</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The password travels once, to one endpoint. After that the client carries only the token, and one dependency decides for every route whether it is valid. The red exits are the status codes captured below.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mật khẩu chỉ đi một lần, tới đúng một endpoint. Sau đó client chỉ mang token, và một dependency quyết định cho mọi route xem token có hợp lệ không. Các lối thoát màu đỏ là status code đã chụp ở dưới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep7c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep7c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep7c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep7c text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep7c .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep7c .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep7c .bl { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .bep7c .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep7c .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep7c .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep7c .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep7c .bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep7c .badhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep7c .sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .bep7c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
